- BASE (Bielefeld Academic Search Engine) is a large multidisciplinary academic search engine operated by Bielefeld University Library, indexing 150–240+ million documents from thousands of sources and focusing strongly on open‑access content. [[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]]

- Document types and DDC:
